// The title's sky shells: the boot module's own variant of the levels' sky routines (0x22ae70, called by its sky
// pass 0x1e9ab8 between the sky's start 0x22b4c8 and end 0x22b558: the overlays' 0x28b680 / 0x28b710). No level's overlay
// carries this routine (tools/overlay_match/front_match.py: only in the boot module; its nearest relative, Veldin's 0x2895a0,
// differs in its loops and constants). Transliterated instruction by instruction from the boot module (SCUS_971.99's own
// image, tools/codegen/ovlist.py front 22ae70) with tools/codegen/mips2cpp.py; its callees are the ports of the same code at Veldin's
// addresses (front_reloc.txt), relocated onto the boot module (OVL_FRONT). Its addresses are the boot module's (no OV: the
// boot module's own code runs only on its own image). Proved against the original.
#include <game/boot/title_sky.h>

